ThreeFExecuting
├── guarded mint
│   ├── requires account as policy caller
│   ├── binds shared principal and yield inputs to live authorization
│   ├── one runtime request drives mint and the nested consume/approval input
│   ├── reuses the same recipe and leaf across new auctions
│   ├── validates factory membership, facility binding and funding token
│   ├── consumes the configured funding-token/collateral-underlying budget
│   ├── pins the pair and checks its exact budget debit, including period rollover
│   ├── rejects retargeting to another enabled pair before or after an earlier mint
│   ├── rejects changing the pinned underlying without a new leaf
│   ├── resets allowance, approves exact principal, mints and clears allowance
│   ├── rejects unsuccessful approvals and nonzero remaining allowance
│   └── preserves direct guarded account management
├── audited runtime compatibility
│   ├── binds every masked request target and argument from one executor input
│   ├── reads authorization in the executor; native mint enforces cap and yield floor
│   ├── uses fresh full-width tuple reads before and after mint
│   └── accepts legacy tuple flags without emitting retired opcodes
└── funding and authorization
    ├── funds from idle assets and ordered sources without spending adapter reserves
    ├── native mint rejects over-cap principal and under-floor yield
    ├── rejects insufficient budgets and low yield
    ├── requires the exact committed template, proof and leaf role
    ├── rejects independent raw-mint permissions
    └── rolls back funding, budget and approvals on failure
